[Intro]
[00:02.63]Heyr oss, Skogarmóðir
[00:05.82]Heyr oss, Næturkonungr
[00:09.83]Vér gangum í eldinn

[Verse 1]
[00:43.94]Through the birken gates we treadeth
[00:46.37]Where the wolfsbane crowneth stone
[00:48.64]Bear the antler, bear the ashen blade
[00:51.22]Blood of mine to feed thine own

[00:53.61]Nine the torches, nine the stridings
[00:55.84]Nine the names we shall not speak
[00:58.30]Hark, the hollow oak it openeth
[01:00.81]What the deep wood seeks, we seek

[Pre-Chorus]
[01:03.37]Bind the bone, bind the breath
[01:05.54]Bind the moon unto the moss

[Chorus]
[01:08.69]Rise, ye horned and hallowed kin!
[01:11.14]Rise from root and ravens' rest!
[01:13.51]Drink the flame, the elder wine
[01:16.00]Crown us in the witching mist
[01:18.48]Rise, ye old ones, rise within!
[01:20.85]Rise the storm beneath the pines!
[01:23.40]Sing the song the stones did sing
[01:25.76]Ere the first of suns did rise

[Verse 2]
[01:47.55]Sister-wolves, they speaketh true
[01:49.87]In the tongue of frost and fern
[01:52.36]Mother-bear, she watcheth still
[01:54.73]By the cairn where torches burn

[01:57.20]Carry me unto the marrow
[01:59.64]Carry me past sun and sea
[02:02.17]What was sundered, what was buried
[02:04.50]Greeneth now within the tree

[Pre-Chorus]
[02:07.22]Bind the bone, bind the breath
[02:09.65]Bind the moon unto the moss

[Chorus]
[02:15.05]Rise, ye horned and hallowed kin!
[02:17.48]Rise from root and ravens' rest!
[02:19.84]Drink the flame, the elder wine
[02:22.38]Crown us in the witching mist
[02:24.81]Rise, ye old ones, rise within!
[02:27.22]Rise the storm beneath the pines!
[02:29.76]Sing the song the stones did sing
[02:32.19]Ere the first of suns did rise

[Bridge]
[02:44.59]And lo, the wind doth knoweth me
[02:49.43]And lo, the dark doth nameth me
[02:53.78]I am the stag, I am the spear
[02:56.42]I am the wound, I am the year

[Breakdown]
[02:59.54]Hark! Hark! Hark!
[03:03.23]The wood awakeneth!

[Final Chorus]
[03:26.74]Rise, ye horned and hallowed kin!
[03:28.85]Rise from root and ravens' rest!
[03:31.43]Drink the flame, the elder wine
[03:33.88]Crown us in the witching mist
[03:36.51]Rise, ye old ones, rise within!
[03:38.76]Rise the storm beneath the pines!
[03:41.29]Sing the song the stones did sing
[03:43.64]Ere the first of suns did rise

[Outro]
[03:56.24]Heyr oss, Skogarmóðir
[04:00.97]Vér erum heim komin
